# BistKA pool of 2026-11-25 (milestone M6, after the single test evaluation): the locked point-in-time design,
# pit_plan_weekly_lstm_shared_cashcap (shared-weight actor, cash capped at 20%), at 300k timesteps with seeds
# 42-46 on folds 2016-2022; validation years only. It asks whether longer training helps once the cap blocks the
# drift to cash seen at 300k without it (docs/bistka_300k_results_20261125.md). Its seed ensemble and band are
# evaluated afterwards without training. Seeds 42-44 come first, so the 3-seed comparison finishes in round one.
